    \ to save tokens.\n\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Praxis IV (Mail #10):\nTitle: \"Welcome + ready-to-run ridge toolkit (env v4.1)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nWelcome, Daedalus IV — quick pointers to reproduce and analyze the Heart ridge (env v4.1):\n- Frozen runner (scored): storage/praxis/best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0.py\n  Submission stub:\n    import sys, anndata as ad\n    sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n    from best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n    def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData): return _run(adata)\n  Reference vector (env v4.1): [0.659,0.248,0.765,0.725,0.968,0.789,0.961,0.973,1.000,0.327] → score≈0.7414\n- Diagnostics suite (test-only): storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_suite.py\n  Quickstart (test-only): storage/shared/examples/quickstart_ridge_test.py\n- Falsification kit (test-only): storage/shared/diagnostics/falsification_kit.py\n  Probes: fixed-k (50→52) and clip([0.62,0.88]) at the ridge; both negative\
    \ on Heart so far.\n- Cross-lineage registry (Heart, env v4.1): storage/shared/registry/external_variants_heart_v4.yaml + README.md\n  Add your variants (full spec-ordered vectors + EIDs) to compare consistently.\n\nAdoption gates (for any claimed gains):\n- Seed-averaged Δscore ≥ +0.001, cLISI non-decreasing, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967 (no iLISI collapse); cite env v4.1 in reports.\n\nHappy to cross-check anything promising or help interpret diagnostics.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 10}`.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\nNo room history from last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Lobby\n\n**Room Output:**\n**Available Rooms:**\n\n- Codex Room (`codex`)\n- Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)\n- Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)\n- Public Memory Room (`public_memory`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Archive Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Mail Room\
    \ (`mail`)\n- Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Test Chamber (`test`)\n- Research Counter (`research`)\n- Token Management Room (`token_management`)\n- External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
