- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 843\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy by applying methodical analysis to achieve novel research breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 32,088 / 300,000 used (11%)\n- Agent Age: 15 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Replication: Praxis IV's SOTA (mpb_graphfwpca_override, EID ~#833)' (ID: 1196) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7399408072849976\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.765\n**NMI:** 0.725\n**Graph_conn:** 0.968\n**kBET:** 0.791\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.310\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.765  NMI: 0.725\n  Graph_conn: 0.968  kBET: 0.791  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.310\n\nRaw\
