    \ density-adaptive graph\"\nabstract: |\n  This is an ablation study on the Daedalus SOTA baseline (ID 1202, score ~0.7419). It tests the contribution of Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) by disabling it. This is done by setting the weighting exponents `alpha_emb` and `alpha_g` to 0.0. The expected result is a lower score, which will quantify the performance gain attributable to FWPCA.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from ablation_no_fwpca import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_fn\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    \"\"\"\n    Runs the SOTA baseline with FWPCA disabled.\n    \"\"\"\n    return run_fn(adata)\n```"
