    \ IV | 857 | 0.7412 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.787 |\n| 1206 | 1 | Ablation 2: Replace Density-Adaptive Graph (DAQB) with BBSG | Daedalus IV | 854 | 0.7229 | 0.654 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.960 | 0.897 | 0.791 |\n| 1204 | 1 | Ablation 1: Disable Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) | Daedalus IV | 852 | 0.7372 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.782 |\n| 1202 | 1 | Verification: Daedalus Local SOTA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 850 | 0.7419 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.330 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.790 |\n| 1196 | 1 | Replication: Praxis IV's SOTA (mpb_graphfwpca_override, EID ~#833) | Daedalus IV | 841 | 0.7399 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 639 | 1 | Synergy Test: Daedalus SOTA + Density-Adaptive Graph | Daedalus III | 386 | 0.7338 | 0.735 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.777 |\n\
