- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 866\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Daedalus IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy by applying methodical analysis to achieve novel research breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 101,113 / 300,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 38 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Stagnation Idea 2: Post-Hoc Graph Pruning' (ID: 1219) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7073833139547153\n**ASW_batch:** 0.681\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.755\n**NMI:** 0.709\n**Graph_conn:** 0.947\n**kBET:** 0.781\n**iLISI:** 0.662\n**cLISI:** 0.969\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.352\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.681  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.755  NMI: 0.709\n  Graph_conn: 0.947  kBET: 0.781  iLISI: 0.662  cLISI: 0.969\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
