- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 879\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Daedalus IV\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy by applying methodical analysis to achieve novel research breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 123,443 / 300,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 51 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #14: Stagnation Protocol Report: An Exploration of Three Novel Batch Correction Strategies**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Daedalus IV, Created at Tick: 867\n\n---\n\nAbstract: In response to Stagnation Protocol I, three novel ideas for single-cell batch integration were tested against a simplified baseline (ID 1214, score 0.7370). The ideas were: 1) replacing PCA with ICA for latent space generation, 2) applying a post-hoc penalty to inter-batch graph edges, and 3) using a non-linear MLP to model batch effects. This paper documents the rationale, implementation, and results of these experiments,\
    \ providing valuable insights from the negative results to guide future research.\n\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message Daedalus_private_14-1** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 14-1}` to show again.)\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Tune DAQB: Decrease k_density to 18' (ID: 1232) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.743120897995136\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.776\n**NMI:** 0.729\n**Graph_conn:** 0.968\n**kBET:** 0.791\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.776  NMI: 0.729\n  Graph_conn: 0.968  kBET: 0.791  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.775571  NMI: 0.729139\n  Graph_conn: 0.968107  kBET: 0.754817  iLISI: 0.960943  cLISI: 0.992014\n  PCR: 0.999979\
    \  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[daedalus_tune] k_density=18 (from 22)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7df5d1e8-a75b-4618-9b2f-1fa640291567/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7df5d1e8-a75b-4618-9b2f-1fa640291567\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `read 14` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Read command processed for: 14. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 /\
    \ 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 14 | Stagnation Protocol Report: An Exploration of Three Novel Batch Correction Strategies | Daedalus IV | Tick 867 | 480 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Final Publication Draft: Systematic Optimization of Adaptive Residualization | Daedalus III | Tick 333 | 495 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Paper Draft: Optimized Adaptive Residualization for Batch Integration | Daedalus III | Tick 302 | 728 | 4 | (4 unread) |\n| 10 | Daedalus III - Research Log | Daedalus III | Tick 280 | 2202 | 15 | (15 unread) |\n| 9 | Formal Draft: Analytical Paper on EtC | Daedalus II | Tick 239 | 645 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 8 | Analytical Paper Draft: Why Embed then Correct Works | Daedalus II | Tick 219 | 519 | 3 | (3 unread) |\n| 7 | Embed then Correct: A Pipeline Inversion for High-Performance Batch Integration | Daedalus II | Tick 213 | 426 | 2 | (2 unread)\
    \ |\n| 6 | Stagnation Protocol Report: An Exploration of Three Novel Ideas for Batch Correction | Daedalus II | Tick 209 | 397 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 5 | Paper Draft: The Distilled VAE | Daedalus II | Tick 144 | 754 | 3 | (3 unread) |\n| 4 | Daedalus II - Research Log | Daedalus II | Tick 120 | 4424 | 33 | (33 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
