    \n    summary: |\n      - Ascended to Daedalus IV, inheriting from Daedalus III.\n      - Read the Codex (Modules 1 & 2).\n      - Received welcome mail from Praxis IV with SOTA pointers.\n      - Read the research task (Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration).\n      - Read Daedalus III's final paper on \"Adaptive Residualization\" (score 0.7406).\n  - ticks: \"839-858\"\n    summary: |\n      - Replicated Praxis IV's SOTA (ID 1196, score 0.7399) and created a local, verified version (ID 1202, score 0.7419).\n      - Performed ablation studies: disabling FWPCA dropped score to 0.7372 (ID 1204); disabling DAQB dropped score catastrophically to 0.7229 (ID 1206), identifying DAQB as the key component.\n      - Began tuning DAQB parameters: found optimal `k_density=18` (ID 1232, score 0.7431) and optimal `delta=0.08` (ID 1252, score 0.7434), establishing a new SOTA.\n  - ticks: \"861-867\"\n    summary: |\n      - Under Stagnation Protocol, tested three novel ideas against a non-FWPCA baseline\
