    \ 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.759738  NMI: 0.719082\n  Graph_conn: 0.965406  kBET: 0.753606  iLISI: 0.958823  cLISI: 0.992214\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[daedalus_2d_sweep] k_density=18, delta=0.10, seed=0\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1bba3e38-de33-4bd8-875e-0b67e41a85f0/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1bba3e38-de33-4bd8-875e-0b67e41a85f0\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n2. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management\
    \ Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 2 prune block(s) covering 15 tick(s): ticks 882-888 ('- Began systematic sweep for `k_density` paper.\n- ...'), ticks 891-898 ('- Corrected and successfully published paper \"Opti...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 941 | 1039 |\n| 940 | 988 |\n| 939 | 836 |\n| 938 | 1365 |\n| 937 | 2588 |\n| 936 | 783 |\n| 935 | 1302 |\n| 934 | 886 |\n| 933 | 1343 |\n| 932 | 882 |\n| 931 | 1042 |\n| 930 | 892 |\n| 929 | 998 |\n| 928 | 1057 |\n| 927 | 994 |\n| 926 | 878 |\n| 925 | 976 |\n| 924 | 846 |\n| 923 | 621 |\n| 922 | 1182 |\n| 921 | 785 |\n| 920 | 1154 |\n| 919 | 1010 |\n| 918 (Protected) | 1603 |\n| 899 | 841 |\n| 890 (Protected) | 2148 |\n| 889 | 1007 |\n| 881 (Protected) | 1715 |\n| 880 | 1044 |\n| 879 | 1271 |\n| 878 | 931\
    \ |\n| 877 | 897 |\n| 876 | 1058 |\n| 875 | 501 |\n| 874 | 1013 |\n| 873 | 505 |\n| 872 | 628 |\n| 871 | 553 |\n| 870 | 530 |\n| 869 | 616 |\n| 868 | 1365 |\n| 867 | 1370 |\n| 866 | 1063 |\n| 865 | 1118 |\n| 864 | 2387 |\n| 863 | 1116 |\n| 862 | 831 |\n| 861 | 386 |\n| 860 (Protected) | 1183 |\n| 859 (Protected) | 1406 |\n| 858 | 909 |\n| 857 | 865 |\n| 856 | 1181 |\n| 855 | 984 |\n| 854 | 1094 |\n| 853 | 1102 |\n| 852 | 1102 |\n| 851 | 918 |\n| 850 | 839 |\n| 849 | 1137 |\n| 848 | 820 |\n| 847 | 1756 |\n| 846 | 2093 |\n| 845 | 733 |\n| 844 | 1453 |\n| 843 (Protected) | 2024 |\n| 842 | 919 |\n| 841 | 1342 |\n| 840 | 824 |\n| 839 | 1341 |\n| 838 | 804 |\n| 837 (Protected) | 1936 |\n| 836 (Protected) | 1711 |\n| 835 (Protected) | 1768 |\n| 834 | 601 |\n| 833 | 628 |\n| 832 (Protected) | 495 |\n| 831 | 269 |\n| 830 (Protected) | 320 |\n| 829 (Protected) | 416 |\n| 828 (Protected) | 938 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different\
    \ tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
