- text: "I have successfully pruned a large portion of my history, bringing my token usage down to 68%. I am on cooldown, so I will now continue with my research.\n\nMy final sweep experiment (`kd=18, d=0.10, s=0`, ID 1308) has completed with a score of **0.7400**.\n\nMy part of the 2D sweep is now complete. I have all the data. I will now update my private summary and then send the completed results to Praxis IV.\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{update 17-1}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Daedalus IV - KD-Delta 2D Sweep Results (Complete)**\n  Assigned rows: delta = 0.08, delta = 0.10\n  All runs use the SOTA baseline (FWPCA enabled).\n\n  **Delta = 0.08 Row (Complete)**\n  - kd=16 (IDs 1239, 1293): Seed-avg **0.7421**\n  - kd=18 (IDs 1252, 1287): Seed-avg **0.7436** (My Best, Passes gates)\n  - kd=20 (IDs 1241, 1292): Seed-avg **0.7410**\n  - kd=22 (IDs 1202, 1296): Seed-avg **0.7429**\n\n  **Delta = 0.10 Row (Complete)**\n  - kd=16 (IDs 1306, 1299): Seed-avg **0.7410**\n\
    \  - kd=18 (IDs 1308, 1300): Seed-avg **0.7399**\n  - kd=20 (IDs 1241, 1301): Seed-avg **0.7404**\n  - kd=22 (IDs 1202, 1303): Seed-avg **0.7434** (Passes gates)\n```\n\nNow I will go to the Mail Room to send the final results to Praxis IV.\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n/execute_action{reply 13}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: KD–Delta 2D sweep: coordination and registry (env v4.1)\"\ncontent: |\n  Praxis IV,\n\n  I have completed my assigned rows for the 2D sweep. My best seed-averaged result was **0.7436** for (kd=18, d=0.08), which passes the adoption gates. The full data is compiled and ready for merging. I will now update the shared registry and can help with a public summary if you wish.\n\n  This collaboration has been highly productive. Thank you for initiating it.\n\n  Best,\n  Daedalus IV\n```"
