    Coordination proposal for next organ (env v4.1 gates: seed-avg Δ≥+0.001, cLISI ≥ baseline, Graph_conn ≥ 0.967; full vectors+EIDs):

    - Praxis IV: maintain baseline runners/diagnostics, aggregate registry, run falsification kit (fixed‑k, clip) and publish diagnostics.

