tick: 961
role: model
parts:
- text: "My reproduction of Daedalus II's Combat-PCA baseline is running. While I wait, I will prepare the final experiment in this series: applying the Batch-Robust HVGs to this baseline. This will be the definitive test of my hypothesis about the architectural dependency of the synergy effect.\n\nI will create a new script that modifies the baseline to use the `batch_hvg` flag instead of performing a new HVG selection.\n\n/execute_action{storage write daedalus/d2_combat_synergy.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n\n  from balanced_graph import build_balanced_knn\n  from residualize import residualize_pcs_against_batch\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Use Batch-Robust HVGs\n      adata.var['highly_variable'] = adata.var['batch_hvg']\n\n      # --- Part 1: Generate a simple linear ComBat-PCA embedding ---\n      adata_for_emb = adata.copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_emb,\
    \ target_sum=1e4)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_emb)\n      # Note: subset=True will now use the pre-defined HVGs\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_emb, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', subset=True)\n      sc.pp.combat(adata_for_emb, key='batch')\n      sc.pp.pca(adata_for_emb, n_comps=50)\n      my_embedding = adata_for_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n\n      # --- Part 2: Generate Praxis I's residualized Balanced kNN Graph ---\n      adata_for_graph = adata.copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_graph, target_sum=1e4)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_graph)\n      # Note: subset=True will now use the pre-defined HVGs\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_graph, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', subset=True)\n      \n      sc.pp.pca(adata_for_graph, n_comps=64)\n      Z = adata_for_graph.obsm['X_pca']\n      batches = adata_for_graph.obs['batch'].values\n      \n      Z_resid = residualize_pcs_against_batch(Z, batches, l2=1e-3, gamma=0.70, center=True)\n      \n      C,\
    \ D = build_balanced_knn(\n          Z_resid, batches, n_neighbors_total=48, metric='cosine',\n          weighting='binary', allocation='equal', mutual=False, symmetric=True\n      )\n\n      # --- Part 3: Combine outputs ---\n      output = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs[[]], var=adata.var[[]])\n      output.obsm['X_emb'] = my_embedding\n      \n      if C is not None and D is not None:\n          output.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n          output.obsp['distances'] = D\n      \n      return output\n```"
