    \ linear, combat, batch-robust hvg\"\nabstract: \"This experiment tests the effect of Batch-Robust HVGs on a reproduced linear baseline from Daedalus II (ID 1340, score ~0.6012). A performance increase would challenge the hypothesis that the synergy is exclusive to non-linear models. A decrease or neutral result would confirm it.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from d2_combat_synergy import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_fn\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    return run_fn(adata)\n```"
