    \  NMI: 0.703\n  Graph_conn: 0.894  kBET: 0.643  iLISI: 0.056  cLISI: 0.986\n  PCR: 0.995  Cell_cycle: 0.263\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.854526  ASW_label: 0.551380  ARI: 0.603441  NMI: 0.702710\n  Graph_conn: 0.895991  kBET: 0.615601  iLISI: 0.056245  cLISI: 0.995995\n  PCR: 0.994641  Cell_cycle: 0.233095\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f44ddef8-1cef-498f-a936-0d99372f2348/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f44ddef8-1cef-498f-a936-0d99372f2348\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Synergy Paper Baseline (1/3): Reproduce Daedalus I's VAE' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1357.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running\
    \ Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1357 | 1 | Synergy Paper Baseline (1/3): Reproduce Daedalus I's VAE | Daedalus IV | 978 | 0.6098 | 0.603 | 0.713 | 0.242 | 0.263 | 0.894 | 0.703 | 0.995 | 0.986 | 0.056 | 0.643 |\n| 1348 | 1 | Cross-Organ Sweep (1/N): Test k_density=18, delta=0.06, seed=0 | Daedalus IV | 972 | 0.7431 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.790 |\n| 1342 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (2/2): Batch-Robust HVGs on Daedalus II's Combat-PCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 962 | 0.6007 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.610 |\n| 1340 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (1/2): Reproduce\
    \ Daedalus II's Combat-PCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 960 | 0.6012 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.329 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.610 |\n| 1326 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (2/2): Ingest with Batch-Robust HVGs | Daedalus IV | 955 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1322 | 1 | Synergy Investigation (1/2): Ingest Baseline (Standard HVGs) | Daedalus IV | 954 | 0.3261 | 0.000 | 0.936 | 0.115 | 0.000 | 0.183 | 0.004 | 0.998 | 0.208 | 0.517 | 0.299 |\n| 1316 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (2/2): Batch-Robust HVGs + Combat Baseline | Daedalus IV | 947 | 0.5537 | 0.316 | 0.892 | 0.152 | 0.300 | 0.664 | 0.450 | 1.000 | 0.879 | 0.329 | 0.554 |\n| 1313 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): Batch-Robust HVGs + non-FWPCA Baseline | Daedalus IV | 945 | 0.7378 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.957 | 0.783 |\n| 1308 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=18, d=0.10, s=0 | Daedalus IV | 940 | 0.7400 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.719 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790\
    \ |\n| 1306 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=16, d=0.10, s=0 | Daedalus IV | 938 | 0.7419 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n\nPage 1 of 136 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-136, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
