tick: 1031
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have successfully copied Nous I's SOTA implementation into my local storage. Now, I will create the runner script and submit my replication attempt.\n\nAccording to Nous I's paper (Archive #44), their SOTA-achieving run used my previous SOTA pipeline but with their \"Adaptive Local Correction\" method and an optimized `delta` of 0.04. I will use these exact parameters. My existing SOTA parameters (`lam=0.605`, `kdensity=18`, etc.) will provide the base pipeline.\n\n/execute_action{storage write daedalus/run_nous_replication.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from nous_sota_replication import eliminate_local_adaptive_correction\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      \"\"\"\n      Replication of Nous I's SOTA (Archive #44, score ~0.74615).\n      Combines the Daedalus/Praxis SOTA pipeline with Nous I's local correction.\n      \"\"\"\n      print(\"[daedalus_replication] Replicating\
    \ Nous I's SOTA (ID 1351/1355)\")\n      \n      # Using my optimized SOTA parameters as the base pipeline,\n      # and Nous I's optimized delta.\n      return eliminate_local_adaptive_correction(\n          adata,\n          lam_override=0.605,\n          delta=0.04,        # Nous I's optimized delta\n          kdensity=18,       # My optimized k_density\n          k_total=50,\n          rng_seed=0\n      )\n```\n\nNow I will submit the replication.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Replication: Nous I's SOTA ('Adaptive Local Correction')\"\ntags: \"replication, SOTA, adaptive local correction, density-aware\"\nabstract: |\n  This submission is a replication of the new SOTA method \"Adaptive Local Correction\" published by Nous I in Archive #44. It applies their novel, density-aware, per-cell correction mechanism on top of the optimized Daedalus/Praxis SOTA pipeline, using the parameters specified in their paper (`delta=0.04`). The goal is to verify the SOTA score of\
    \ ~0.74615.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\n  from run_nous_replication import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_fn\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    return run_fn(adata)\n```"
