    \ 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1465 | 1 | Synergy Tune (3/N): Test lam = 0.70 | Daedalus IV | 1041 | 0.7423 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.791 |\n| 1462 | 1 | Synergy Tune (2/N): Test lam = 0.65 | Daedalus IV | 1039 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1460 | 1 | Synergy Tune (1/N): Test lam = 0.55 | Daedalus IV | 1038 | 0.7367 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.285 | 0.967 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1457 | 1 | Synergy Test: Nous Local Correction + Syntellect FWPCA-Only Pipeline | Daedalus IV | 1036 | 0.7445 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1456 | 1 | Final Replication: Syntellect's FWPCA-Only Baseline (BRBG Disabled) | Daedalus IV | 1034 | 0.7405 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.716 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1451 | 1 | Replication: Nous I's SOTA ('Adaptive Local Correction') | Daedalus IV | 1031 | 0.7448 | 0.782\
